+/*
+ * On Windows the control edits a real MSHTML document (through TriEdit): the
+ * document is loaded into MSHTML, switched to design mode, its DOM is the
+ * control's DOM property, and the DECMD_ commands are MSHTML editing commands.
+ * This file hosts that document: it is the document's client site, in-place
+ * site, frame and UI handler, and tells the control when a load completes and
+ * when the person asks for a context menu.
+ */
